    {
      "start": "00:04:36,960",
      "end": "00:04:38,296",
      "text": "What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:04:38,330",
      "end": "00:04:40,498",
      "text": "No time to explain. Run away."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:04:45,035",
      "end": "00:04:47,037",
      "text": "Oh, hey, Sammy."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:04:47,072",
      "end": "00:04:48,939",
      "text": "You really got those moves locked down now, hmm?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:04:48,972",
      "end": "00:04:50,575",
      "text": "I sure do, Mr. Moon."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:04:50,608",
      "end": "00:04:53,244",
      "text": "Yeah, look at you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:04:53,278",
      "end": "00:04:56,013",
      "text": "Great job, everybody. Great job."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:04:56,046",
      "end": "00:04:57,649",
      "text": "- Thanks, Mr. Moon. - Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:04:57,682",
      "end": "00:05:00,218",
      "text": "I think we pretty much nailed it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:00,251",
      "end": "00:05:01,486",
      "text": "So, is she here?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:03,655",
      "end": "00:05:06,057",
      "text": "There. See the dog, middle third row?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:06,091",
      "end": "00:05:07,625",
      "text": "Oh, she's younger than I imagined."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:07,659",
      "end": "00:05:09,127",
      "text": "Yeah, well, supposedly,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:09,160",
      "end": "00:05:10,928",
      "text": "she's the best scout in show business."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:10,961",
      "end": "00:05:12,630",
      "text": "I can't tell if-if she's enjoying it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:12,664",
      "end": "00:05:14,632",
      "text": "Come on, let's get a better view."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:14,666",
      "end": "00:05:16,401",
      "text": "♪ This I know ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:16,434",
      "end": "00:05:21,072",
      "text": "♪ He told me, \"Don't worry about it\" ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:21,106",
      "end": "00:05:25,076",
      "text": "♪ He told me, \"Don't worry no more\" ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:25,110",
      "end": "00:05:27,545",
      "text": "♪ We both know we can't go... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:27,579",
      "end": "00:05:30,115",
      "text": "And how we doing over here, Miss Crawly?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:30,148",
      "end": "00:05:32,083",
      "text": "Oh, very good, Mr. Moon."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:32,117",
      "end": "00:05:34,486",
      "text": "So far, I counted nine smiles,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:34,519",
      "end": "00:05:37,389",
      "text": "two belly laughs and five chuckles."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:37,422",
      "end": "00:05:40,258",
      "text": "Uh, though the last one could've just been gas."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:40,291",
      "end": "00:05:42,660",
      "text": "Well, that's proof, right? She must like the show."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:42,694",
      "end": "00:05:44,396",
      "text": "- Oh, my gosh. You think so? - I hope so."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:44,429",
      "end": "00:05:46,164",
      "text": "All right, now, keep up the good work."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:46,197",
      "end": "00:05:47,998",
      "text": "Come on, everybody, back to positions."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:48,031",
      "end": "00:05:49,701",
      "text": "She'd be, like, cuckoo not to love the show."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:49,734",
      "end": "00:05:52,137",
      "text": "Dream big dreams."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:52,170",
      "end": "00:05:53,705",
      "text": "That's what I always said, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:53,738",
      "end": "00:05:55,273",
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:55,306",
      "end": "00:05:57,409",
      "text": "Well, looks like we're about to take this show"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:05:57,442",
      "end": "00:06:00,412",
      "text": "to the entertainment capital of the world."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:00,445",
      "end": "00:06:02,547",
      "text": "Mr. Moon, she's leaving."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:02,580",
      "end": "00:06:04,682",
      "text": "- Huh? - She's leaving the show."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:04,716",
      "end": "00:06:07,218",
      "text": "♪ He told me, \"You'll never...\" ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:07,252",
      "end": "00:06:09,421",
      "text": "Miss Crawly, stay right here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:09,454",
      "end": "00:06:11,723",
      "text": "- What are you gonna do? - I'm gonna follow that dog."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:11,756",
      "end": "00:06:13,391",
      "text": "- ♪ Whoo! ♪ - ♪ I can't feel my face ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:13,425",
      "end": "00:06:14,592",
      "text": "♪ When I'm with you ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:14,626",
      "end": "00:06:16,661",
      "text": "♪ I can't feel my face, yeah... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:16,694",
      "end": "00:06:18,563",
      "text": "Good heavens!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:18,596",
      "end": "00:06:20,632",
      "text": "- Hey, Nana. - What are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:20,665",
      "end": "00:06:21,999",
      "text": "The scout is leaving."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:22,032",
      "end": "00:06:23,168",
      "text": "♪ I can't feel my face... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:23,201",
      "end": "00:06:25,303",
      "text": "Ah, so she is."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:25,336",
      "end": "00:06:27,037",
      "text": "Hurry."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:31,109",
      "end": "00:06:33,010",
      "text": "Uh, Suki? Suki Lane?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:33,043",
      "end": "00:06:34,612",
      "text": "I'm Buster Moon."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:34,646",
      "end": "00:06:36,181",
      "text": "Uh, hi. So glad you could make it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:36,214",
      "end": "00:06:37,549",
      "text": "Um, would you like some popcorn?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:37,582",
      "end": "00:06:39,049",
      "text": "Oh, no, thanks."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:39,083",
      "end": "00:06:40,718",
      "text": "I'm not staying for the second half, so..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:40,752",
      "end": "00:06:42,487",
      "text": "Oh. But, uh, we thought you were enjoying it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:42,520",
      "end": "00:06:44,522",
      "text": "I mean, not that we were watching you or anything."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:44,556",
      "end": "00:06:47,991",
      "text": "It really is a cute little show."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:48,025",
      "end": "00:06:49,494",
      "text": "Just not what we're looking for."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:49,527",
      "end": "00:06:51,496",
      "text": "But-but wait. Y-You got to see the second act."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:51,529",
      "end": "00:06:53,498",
      "text": "I'm-I'm telling you, it's a smash."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:53,531",
      "end": "00:06:55,133",
      "text": "Okay, Mr. Moon, can I be honest?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:55,166",
      "end": "00:06:57,135",
      "text": "- Of course. - Are you sure?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:57,168",
      "end": "00:06:59,036",
      "text": "'Cause folks say that when they don't really mean it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:59,070",
      "end": "00:07:01,072",
      "text": "No, please, please, be as honest as you like."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:01,105",
      "end": "00:07:02,740",
      "text": "You're not good enough."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:02,774",
      "end": "00:07:04,309",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:04,342",
      "end": "00:07:06,077",
      "text": "Taxi!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:06,110",
      "end": "00:07:09,180",
      "text": "You know, maybe I will have that popcorn."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:09,214",
      "end": "00:07:12,250",
      "text": "Look, you've got a nice little local theater here,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:12,283",
      "end": "00:07:14,385",
      "text": "and it's great for what it is,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:14,419",
      "end": "00:07:17,622",
      "text": "but trust me, you'd never make it in the big leagues."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:17,655",
      "end": "00:07:20,091",
      "text": "Bye, now."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:23,695",
      "end": "00:07:26,698",
      "text": "Well, what did she say?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:26,731",
      "end": "00:07:29,032",
      "text": "I'll be right back."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:29,067",
      "end": "00:07:30,802",
      "text": "Nah. Mm-mm."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:30,835",
      "end": "00:07:33,171",
      "text": "A few laughs, bunch of quirky ideas."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:33,204",
      "end": "00:07:36,140",
      "text": "But, anyway, about Thursday..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:36,174",
      "end": "00:07:38,142",
      "text": "Oh, my..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:38,176",
      "end": "00:07:39,777",
      "text": "Yeah, hi. It's me again."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:41,279",
      "end": "00:07:42,180",
      "text": "Whoa."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:42,213",
      "end": "00:07:44,616",
      "text": "- Whoa. - I'll call you back."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:44,649",
      "end": "00:07:46,584",
      "text": "Are you out of your mind?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:46,618",
      "end": "00:07:47,752",
      "text": "When are you holding auditions?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:47,785",
      "end": "00:07:49,254",
      "text": "Tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:49,287",
      "end": "00:07:50,655",
      "text": "But there is no way you'll..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:50,688",
      "end": "00:07:51,789",
      "text": "Uh, listen, it..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:51,823",
      "end": "00:07:53,191",
      "text": "Get out of the road, you idiot!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:53,224",
      "end": "00:07:55,360",
      "text": "Hey, do you mind? I'm in a meeting here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:55,393",
      "end": "00:07:57,161",
      "text": "Could-could you at least give us a chance"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:57,195",
      "end": "00:07:58,530",
      "text": "to try out for your boss?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:58,563",
      "end": "00:08:01,132",
      "text": "Driver, could you please lose this maniac?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:08:01,165",
      "end": "00:08:02,333",
      "text": "Wait, wait, wait, wait. Hold on a second."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:08:02,367",
      "end": "00:08:03,668",
      "text": "No, no, no, no!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:08:32,263",
      "end": "00:08:36,200",
      "text": "♪ When are you gonna come down? ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:08:36,234",
      "end": "00:08:39,404",
      "text": "♪ When are you going to land? ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:08:39,437",
      "end": "00:08:42,874",
      "text": "♪ I should have stayed on the farm ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:08:42,907",
      "end": "00:08:47,445",
      "text": "♪ I should have listened to my old man ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:08:47,478",
      "end": "00:08:51,449",
      "text": "♪ You know you can't hold me forever ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:08:51,482",
      "end": "00:08:53,585",
      "text": "♪ I didn't sign up with you ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:08:55,320",
      "end": "00:08:59,791",
      "text": "♪ I'm not a present for your friends to open ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:08:59,824",
      "end": "00:09:03,728",
      "text": "♪ This boy's too young to be singing ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:03,761",
      "end": "00:09:07,365",
      "text": "♪ The blues ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:07,398",
      "end": "00:09:10,868",
      "text": "♪ Ah, ah-ah, ah, ah ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:10,902",
      "end": "00:09:13,871",
      "text": "♪ Ah, ah, ah ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:13,905",
      "end": "00:09:15,473",
      "text": "Mr. Moon?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:15,506",
      "end": "00:09:18,843",
      "text": "♪ So goodbye, yellow brick road ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:18,876",
      "end": "00:09:22,380",
      "text": "♪ Where the dogs of society howl ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:22,413",
      "end": "00:09:27,251",
      "text": "♪ You can't plant me in your penthouse ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:27,285",
      "end": "00:09:30,521",
      "text": "♪ I'm going back to my plow ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:30,555",
      "end": "00:09:34,492",
      "text": "♪ Back to the howling old owl in the woods ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:34,525",
      "end": "00:09:37,862",
      "text": "♪ Hunting the horny-back toad... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:40,898",
      "end": "00:09:43,201",
      "text": "Oh, for heaven's sake."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:44,936",
      "end": "00:09:46,771",
      "text": "What can I say, Nana?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:46,804",
      "end": "00:09:48,940",
      "text": "- I'm a failure. - Oh, poppycock."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:48,973",
      "end": "00:09:50,675",
      "text": "I was reaching too high."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:50,708",
      "end": "00:09:54,612",
      "text": "Honestly, one negative comment, and it's all, \"Woe is me.\""
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:54,646",
      "end": "00:09:57,181",
      "text": "Nana, come on. She said I'm not good enough."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:57,215",
      "end": "00:09:59,350",
      "text": "I mean, heck, I've just been told"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:09:59,384",
      "end": "00:10:01,386",
      "text": "that my destiny, all of my hopes and dreams,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:01,419",
      "end": "00:10:03,254",
      "text": "uh, they all end right here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:03,287",
      "end": "00:10:04,656",
      "text": "Well, what did you expect?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:04,689",
      "end": "00:10:07,725",
      "text": "That she would drop to her knees and declare you a genius?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:07,759",
      "end": "00:10:11,262",
      "text": "Roll out the red carpet for the great Buster Moon!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:11,295",
      "end": "00:10:12,930",
      "text": "She-she ran me off the road into a canal."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:12,964",
      "end": "00:10:14,632",
      "text": "Well, you're still in one piece, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:14,666",
      "end": "00:10:16,267",
      "text": "Well, yeah, but..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:16,300",
      "end": "00:10:19,270",
      "text": "Well, anyone who dares set out to follow their dreams"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:19,303",
      "end": "00:10:22,874",
      "text": "is bound to face a lot worse than a dip in the canal."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:10:22,907",
      "end": "00:10:24,542",
      "text": "Ah, Hobbs. I found him."
    }
  ],
  "mimicking": [
