      "text": "Mr. Moon, she's leaving."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:20,665",
      "end": "00:06:21,999",
      "text": "The scout is leaving."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:31,109",
      "end": "00:06:33,010",
      "text": "Uh, Suki? Suki Lane?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:34,646",
      "end": "00:06:36,181",
      "text": "Uh, hi. So glad you could make it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:40,752",
      "end": "00:06:42,487",
      "text": "Oh. But, uh, we thought you were enjoying it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:44,556",
      "end": "00:06:47,991",
      "text": "It really is a cute little show."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:49,527",
      "end": "00:06:51,496",
      "text": "But-but wait. Y-You got to see the second act."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:06:53,531",
      "end": "00:06:55,133",
      "text": "Okay, Mr. Moon, can I be honest?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:07:01,105",
